  "details": "**Steps to reproduce:**\n\n1. Hold the left or right stick in any direction.\n\n2. Open the Action, Quick or Main Menu.\n\n**Actual result:**\n\nThe movement of the stick gets stuck in the direction it was held.\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThe movement ceases when a menu is opened.\n\n**Notes:**\n\n- This issue was not present in previous builds.\n\n- May be related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1489-cant-close-quick-menu-by-moving",
